(Dermatology is the branch of medicine concerned with diagnosis and treatment of skin disorders. AI) Tj
T* (has the potential to improve dermatologic care, especially in undeserved communities. AI is valuable) Tj
T* (in analazying skin images and patient information, enabling faster diagnosis and the more accurate) Tj
T* (identification of skin lesions. Challenges remain in implementation, safety, ethical issues and) Tj
T* (trustworthiness. Blackheads, Whiteheads, Papules, Pustules, and Cysts are the 5 major types of acne) Tj
T* (world-wide. The problem is to accurately detect and classify acne using images of patients.) Tj
