(Large Language Models \(LLMs\) sometimes behave incorrectly by producing harmful, biased, or) Tj
T* (unsafe outputs, even when they appear confident. This paper introduces LLMSCAN, a method that) Tj
T* (detects such misbehavior by analyzing how different internal components of an LLM cause its final) Tj
T* (output. Instead of only checking what the model says, LLMSCAN studies how changing or intervening) Tj
