(Develop an end to end deep learning system that predicts a crystalline materials band gap \(in electron) Tj
T* (volts, eV\) from its natural-language crystal structure description. These descriptions can be generated) Tj
T* (from a CIF \(Crystallographic Information File\) using Robocrystallographer, a tool that automatically) Tj
T* (produces a deterministic, human readable text description of a crystal structure given its CIF file.) Tj
T* (Using an instructor-provided dataset \(or a subset of TextEdge from the LLM Prop work, where LLM =) Tj
T* (Large Language Model\), create training/validation/test splits, preprocess the text, and fine-tune a) Tj
T* (pretrained Transformer encoder \(recommended: the encoder of T5 small, where T5 = Text to Text) Tj
T* (Transfer Transformer\) with a small regression head to output the band gap value. Evaluate and report) Tj
T* (performance using MAE \(Mean Absolute Error\) on a held-out test set, and provide a simple demo) Tj
T* (such as a CLI \(Command Line Interface\) program where a user pastes a crystal description and) Tj
T* (receives the predicted band gap. Submit a runnable code repository, a short report describing the) Tj
T* (dataset, model, training setup, and results, and the demo script; benchmarking against simpler) Tj
T* (baselines and ablation/preprocessing studies are optional if time permits.) Tj
